5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I would like to see if our past efforts were affected by things beyond our control. I'll check the winter road closures north of the river and the county grant terms.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about accessibility. I will look into the bus links in the two outer wards and the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what we already tried! I'll check the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the running and equipment lines last year and the county grant terms and the endowment to see how our funding behaves.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I will review the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as the neighbourhood associations and tool certification.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
